{
  "id": "pane-outline",
  "title": "The presentation destination outlines its hovered pane on the GPU and clear restores the real pointer feed",
  "binding": "The standard authored theme gives the outline an opaque accent. A console-only presentation cursor first sits outside the left-half magenta pane, then inside it. The capture at the composed root reads a top-edge region far from the cursor and its label: a hovered pane replaces magenta with its accent outline. The discriminating leg keeps the override outside the pane, so that same region remains magenta. Clear removes the override and the final capture holds the no-hover edge for the unattended windowed canary. The normal OS pointer is never injected or moved.",
